  "comment": [
    "Machine-readable pins for the third-party types mirrored under internal/apis.",
    "Each entry records the upstream repo, the tag the mirror was extracted from, and the",
    "upstream files it derives from. scripts/check-mirror-drift.py diffs those files between",
    "the pinned tag and the newest matching tag, so upstream changes surface without waiting",
    "for someone to re-extract. A source without `files` is diffed as a whole directory.",
    "Keep `tag` in step with the version named in each package's doc.go."
